{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yrmzl7K51H1795580796.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析認為，港股短期處於上落市的格局。</p><p></p><p>胤源世創家族辦公室(香港)第一副總裁黃偉豪表示︰「我認為港股暫時處於反覆上落的格局，當然個低位是近期的低位，21,998點是比較關鍵的支持。但上方要確認港股進一步企穩，至少要回升至22,500點以上，回升至六月份低位以上，才可以看得較為樂觀一點。後市來說，繼續觀望外圍AI股的表現，以及大家對下個月美國聯儲局加息預期的看法。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.477172+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:37:16.394212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:16.473135+00:00","content_hash":"a475d71eb5760146c323c6a344852dc07c7096dcee324cb715854e159b066591","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.477172+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}